<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="ide">Diñoro dya Jakovo</para>
  <para style="rem">Copyright Information: © 2022 The Seed Company</para>
  <para style="h">JAKOVO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Jakovo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakovo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jakovo</para>
  <para style="rem">Ecidimukithsa</para>
  <para style="rem">Oyu wa ñorire edi diñoro po nedi Jakovo, oyu wekarire mukuru o kereke mu Yerusalema. Nedi mina Yesu o mukwerume. Shime a ñorerire akwakutawa o Majuda awa panthzaanine ku tunda mu Yerusalema ku thza mu mambongi no mu matunga ao. Jakovo eyi a ñorerire edi diñoro po nedi ku tongwera akwakutawa ci thsitawo thso thsaa roera ku monithsiwa kekwama no mwoyo wo ouwa. Shime a wa rongire dyo ku kwama o kwa di mwikarupa yo ku pitura eci mununa, ohepwe, rununa, mavwevwe, iereka, etumaura no mikwangarakanyi. Karo wa wa tongwerire okuru mu thsivaka o kukena, kucihuthsa kushi, thsirombero, othzui nonyanyami mu mwoyo wa mukwakutawa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Yame no Jakovo, mupika Nyambi na Fumu Yesu Krisitu, naa ñorera amwe mwa mikuta thzo dikumi na thzidi thza Isiraele ethzi na thzi panthzaanena mu matunga Anukenge. Naa mi vumenena.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitawo nonyanyami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Andengenu, mu nyanyuke nene iereka yo mishovoshovo o ku i na mi keyera, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />inene mu na dimuka ci ngeci thsitawo thsenu athsopo thsi erekiwa yaa reta ci othzui wenu u kure. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Mu thsie othzui wenu u kure, ci mwikare o kwononoka no ku kwanenena ko kupira thsimweya thso ku fotahara.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ngeci kwaa di ku kwenu oyu na foto onyanyami, a u rombe kwa Nyambi, kenge a u mu pa, aye mupe na panga anu wahe ko kupira ku kumathzeka. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Uno honi o ku na rombo ku kwenthzi, waa roera ku tawa kadi ku tamangera, inene o ku tamangera po aa cipitura eci diñithsingi edi di endithsiwa no ku yerauriwa ku mupepo. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Munu o kengeyo a anekera ci kenge nga a tambura thsinu kwa Fumu, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />inene o di no micima thzidi, ka a tenamine mwinu yoihe eyi a kwama.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ohepwe no rufumo</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Mukwakutawa o hepwe aa roera ku nyanyuka Nyambi o ku na mu cimbura. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />No fumanyi naye aa roera ku nyanyuka Nyambi o ku na mu huthsa kushi, inene fumanyi kenge a ku nonga eci matemo o mu murundu. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Inene diyuwa yoihe di kambeka no ku pya, thsimena thsaa rera no matemo aa kurumukako nowa wao waa pwa. Dyaa kwikara no fumanyi naye, kenge a ku nonga nenu yenthzi yoihe eyi a koña.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iereka nothzui</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Wa thsiyauthzi munu o ku twethsa ku cithzua mwiereka, inene yoihe a tanara, iereka ou ya ku pita kenge a ku wana muyambo o mwoyo o diyere, ou a kumbwethzire Nyambi awa a na mu shimi.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Munu yoihe a tumauriwa a amba ci: “Nyambi oyu ni tumaura,” inene Nyambi tumba a tumauriwa kumango, karo aye ka a tumaurangire munu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Unone munu no munu aa tumauriwa kecikumbwethza yenthzi yoimango eyi i mu hongawera ku ku kwama omango. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Mweyo honi, ecikumbwethza yaereka thsivi, thsivi yoihe thsi kura thsaereka kufa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Aenthzange awa na shima, mwa ciangera mwathsinda. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Thsipa thsothsihe thsothsiwa no kwononoka thsaa tunda ku wiru kwa Nyambi, Tata oyu wa kwamine myethzi thzothzihe thzo diwiru, aye ka a wana mamiru eci mithzimbimbi ethzi thzi thza o thsiuruka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Keshima yenthzi, wa tu pire mwoyo ko diywi dyo shemwa ci nga twikare mutomwa ku yumbiwa yenthzi yoihe.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku yuva no ku tenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Aenthzange awa na shima, mu dimuke eyi, munu yomuhe a yakame ku teerera, unone a katape ku amba no ku anthzipa. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Inene oanthzi o munu tumba u reta owawa ou a fota Nyambi. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Mweyo, mu tunde kwinu yo dithziro no kumango ouhe. Mu tambure ko ku cihuthsa kushi diywi edi na a kunu Nyambi mu micima thzenu, inene dyaa twethsa ku yoyithsa myoyo thzenu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Mwa teereranga pohuma diywi dya Nyambi, unone mwaa roera ku tenda eyi di amba, inene ngeci ka mu tendire kengeyo mwaa ciangera mwathsinda. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Inene o ku teerera pohuma diywi dya Nyambi, unone kadi wa ku kwama eyi di amba, aa cipitura eci munu o ku cikenga thsihanga thsenthzi mu thsiponi. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Uno honi yoihe a mana ku cimona no ku thza, popo aa vurama edi ekara. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />O ku kengerera nawa mu murao o kwononoka o ku twethsa ku rukurura munu, ayepo u hengeka ko kukana ku yuva pohuma no ku vurama, unone aa tenda eyi a na yuvu, oyo munu kenge a ku tambura thsiyauthzi kwa Nyambi mweyi a tenda.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ngeci munu ayepo cishimba ci o di no thsitawo, unone aa kwanga ku kwata rudimi rwenthzi, aa ciangera yothsinda, karo thsitawo thsenthzi thsa tumbako. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Thsitawo thso shemwa thso kupira katamwethzi pa meho a Nyambi Tata wetu po: ku nyunga athsiana no mafakathzi mu makando o, no ku cinyunga kumango ouhe o mu kaye.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsivi thso mavwevwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Andengenu, pakuninga ci mwakwakutawa kwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu o kutethzima, mu thsie mavwevwe. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Tu shimbe kenge ci mu thsiciwano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po sinagoge.</char></note> thsenu kwaa keya munu o fumanyi oyu na vata kanthzea ko gauda nevata yoiwa, karo akopo ku keya hepwe oyu na vata enyakinyaki. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Ngeci amwepo mu monithsa nene direma koya na vata nawa no ku mu ambera ci: “Mu shimbe ethsi thsipura thsothsiwa mwikarepo,” unone mwa ambera oya hepwe ci: “Owe, o katuke o kekare paya,” nji ci “O keye no wikare pashi ku nyonga thzange,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />apo po mu na monithsa thsiano mu kaci kenu no kwikara akwakuratura weanekera yoimango.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Aenthzange awa na shima, mu ni teerere! Nyambi wa hangurire ahepwe muno mu kaye ci ekare afumanyi mu thsitawo, no ku tambura kutumina oku a kumbwethzire awa a na mu shimi. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Uno honi amwe mwaa shwahura ahepwe. Awa na mi dyaterera no ku mi kokakokera ku makuta ne kadi wodiyo awa afumanyi? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Wodiyo karo awa na yengweranga dithzina dyo direma dya Yesu Krisitu oku mu na kundama.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ngeci mwaa hengeka shemwa murao o thsifumu ou u di mu Mañoro o ku ninga ci: “O shime muenthzoe eci edi wa cishima othsinda,” apo mwaa tenda eyi i na roera. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Unone ngeci amwepo mu tenda mavwevwe, apo mwaa tenda thsivi, karo murao waa mi ratura ci mwakwakucora murao. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Inene munu shaanga yoyu hengeka mirao thzothzihe unone aa corapo ofoci, aa shimbiwa ci thzothzihe na thzi coro. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Inene oyu wa ambire ci “Kadi o mukwa ku rembeka,” karo yo wa ambire ci: “Kadi o mukwa kwipaa.” Mweyo, ngeci owe po o wipaa munu, shaanga ko rembekire o na coro murao.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Mweyo, yoihe eyi mu amba no ku tenda mu dimuke ci kenge mwa ku raturiwa ko murao ou u na rukurura anu. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Inene Nyambi ka a kwikara no ñeke apa a ku ratura munu o kupira ñeke kwamweya. Ñeke thzaa othza raturo.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitawo nekwama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Owa wine, andengenu, o ku amba ci: “Ame po ni di no thsitawo” ko kukana ku monithsa ekwama yethso thsitawo thsoe? Ethso thsitawo thso kengeyo ne kenge nga thsi ku yoyithsa nji? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Ngeci waa mona muenthzoe o mukwerume nji o mbuyama oyu na piri edya nevata, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />ine eyi nga i mu kwathsa ku mu ambera ci: “O ende mu thsiyaro, o ka enyenene no ku dya nawa,” ko kukana ku mu pa thsimweya ethsi thsi na fotahara kwirama yenthzi? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Mofoci no thsitawo thso kupira ekwama thsa kufa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Nga munu ayepo amba ci: “Owe o di no thsitawo, ame ni di nekwama,” kenge nga ni mu ambera ci: “O ni monithse edi nga o wikara no thsitawo ko kupira ekwama, name kenge ni ku monithsa thsitawo thsange kekwama yange yoiwa.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Waa tawa ci Nyambi po yofoci,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku di Nyambi yofoci.</char></note> waa kwama nawa! No mathzimu nao aa tawa kengeyo no ku tutuma ku yapa.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Owe o munu sho tomba, ene waa fota ci shime ku ku tongwera ci thsitawo thso kupira ekwama po ka thsi kwathsire thsimweya? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Ene ka mu dimukire ci mukwathsañuru wetu Aburahama wa variwire ci muwawa pa meho a Nyambi kekwama yenthzi uya a tupurire mwanenthzi Isaka pa katara? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Mu na mono, thsitawo thsenthzi nekwama yenthzi ya kwamenine pofoci, ekwama yenthzi ya kwanithserire thsitawo thsenthzi. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ya tendaharire eci edi a amba Mañoro ku ninga ci: “Aburahama wa tawire kwa Nyambi, karo Nyambi wa mu varire ci muwawa mukaci ko thsitawo thsenthzi.” Mane Nyambi wa mwithsire ci mbushe. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Mu na mono honi, munu aa tendiwa o muwawa kekwama kadi ko thsitawo pohuma.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Mofoci karo na Rahaba<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2">Josh 2</ref>.</char></note> oya diherehere, wekarire o muwawa pa meho a Nyambi keyi a kwamine yo ku tambura tuya tunenga no ku wa nehethza dikuñwa dyadyo. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Erama o ku i na piri mupepo ya kufa, mofoci no thsitawo thso kupira ekwama thsa kufa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kukwata rudimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Andengenu, kadi cingwa ci owangi ku kwenu aa roera kwikara arongithsi, inene mu na dimuka ci atwe tu na rongithsanga kenge twa ku raturiwa nene shemwa kupita amweya. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Twaheno twa epithsanga mu makuñwa oangi. Munu yomuhe o kukana kwipithsa mwiambaura yenthzi po wa kwononoka, inene aa twethsa ku endithsa erama yenthzi yoihe.<figure style="fig" alt="Horse controlled by bit in mouth" file="lb00035b.tif" size="col" loc="Jas 3:3-6" copy="Knowles" ref="3.3-6">Kakambe kaa endithsiwa ko tumo mu kanwa</figure><verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Yoihe tu paka matumo mu tunwa to tukambe ci tu tu yuvere, twaa twethsa ku thsiurura erama yato yoihe. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Karo mu anekere okuru o dingunde, shaanga ci dyaa endithsiwa ku mupepo oukuru, dyaa thsiururiwanga ku kapepe kokaonye pohuma no ku twariwa kokuhe oku a na foto muvui. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Mofoci kengeyo no rudimi, kapo kokaonye perama yo munu, unone rwaa cishangara mwinu yoikuru. Karo mu anekere dikuruthsitu dyo ku twethsa ku tumekiwa ku kadiroana pohuma! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Rudimi naro rwaa cipitura eci mudiro, kaye komango perama yo munu. Rwaa twethsa kwipithsa erama yoihe, ku tumeka mwoyo o munu ouhe, aro no ku ka tumekiwa ku dihere.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Munu aa twethsa kwiethza, karo weethzapo mishovo thzothzihe thzekondwama, enyunyi, eharawi no yumbiwa yo mu meyu. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Unone kwithsa oyu weethza rudimi, inene ka rwa cihenga, karo rumango ru na yara ohungu o kwipaa.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Ko rudimi twaa shangara Fumu wetu aye Tata wetu, unone karo twaa ru cikwathsithsa ku kuya anu amweya awa ombire Nyambi mu thsikupuro thsenthzi. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mu kanwa kofoci mwaa tunda kushangara no kukuya. Andengenu, ka i roerire kwikara kengeyo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ene mu dinowa dyofoci ne kenge nga mu va meyu oawa noa o kudyedya? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Andengenu, ene ku thsitondo thsokuyu ne kenge nga kwima miywera nji, nji ku veine kwimako ñuyu? Mofoci no dinowa dyo meyu o kudyedya, tumba mu vu meyu oawa.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyanyami o ku tunda kwa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ene kwaa di ku kwenu oyu di nonyanyami no kuyuvithsithsa? A i monithse ko mwoyo wenthzi ouwa, nekwama yenthzi yoiwa eyi a tenda ko ku cihuthsa kushi nonyanyami. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Unone ngeci micima thzenu thzi na yara mbamba noñondi, mwa cinuneka no kwangera ku amba yo kwithsa poshemwa. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Onyanyami o kengeyo kadi cingwa waa tunda ku wiru, unone wa muno mu kaye, kadi wa ku mupepo karo wa mathzimu. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Inene apa pa di mbamba noñondi paa wanahara mikwangarakanyi nekwama yoihe yoimango.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Uno honi thso kutanga, onyanyami o ku tunda ku wiru awo po ukenu, karo wa thsiyaro, wa kuwamucima, karo wa ku yuvera amweya. Wa ku yara ñeke nekwama yoiwa, ka wa wana mavwevwe nji mahetaheta. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Dicora dyowawa po dyaa kuniwa mu thsiyaro kowa a reta thsiyaro.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Ku henyena kwa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ine eyi i reta makanyi no mamvo mu kaci kenu? Ene kadi yaa tunderera kwicikumbwethza yenu yoimango eyi i cirwithsa mu micima thzenu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mwaa cikumbwethza enu unone ka mu di nayo, mweyo, mu na ciroithsera shaanga kwipaa. Mwaa tendera mbamba eyi a di nayo amweya, unone kadi mwakwa ku i wana, mweyo, mwaa tenda mikwangarakanyi no ku rwa. Ka mu di nayo inene ka mu rombangire kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Karo shaanga yamwe mu romba, tumba mu piwa, inene mwa i rombera eanekera yenu yoimango ci mu ka i cikwathsithse mweyi nga i mi retera kucikora.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Amwe mwanu o kukana ku rurama! Ene ka mu dimukire ci ombusha no kaye po yaa mi retera thsithzimbo na Nyambi? Mweyo, munu yomuhe o ku cihangwera ku cimbusheka no kaye aekara mukwathsithzimbo na Nyambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Nji mwaa anekera ci ya mbango eyi a amba Mañoro ci: “Aa fota nene ko difupa Mupepo ou na a paka mu mwetu”? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Unone aa tu monithsanga thsihemo thsothsikuru kupiterera. Eyo ngeyi a na ambera Mañoro ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">“Nyambi wa ku rwithsa o mununa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">uno honi aa monithsanga thsihemo kowa a na cihuthsa kushi.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Mu cihuthse kushi thza Nyambi honi ne. Mu kanene shamaonga, apo kenge a mi yembuka. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mu henyene kwa Nyambi, naye Nyambi kenge a henyena ku kwenu. Mu yoe moko enu, amwe mwanu o thsivi, karo mu kenithse micima thzenu amwe mwakwa micima thzidi. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mwikare no mathsiwa, mu dire no ku kuana! Tuheko twenu tu piruke thsidiro, no thsinyanyu thsenu thsi piruke mathsiwa! <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mu cihuthse kushi pa meho a Fumu, aye kenge a mi yerura ku mi ku rithsa.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa ratura amweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Andengenu, mwa cipithsa oandu mathzina. O kwipithsa dithzina muenthzenthzi nji ku mu ratura, aa rwithsa murao no ku u ratura. Unone o ku ratura murao, ka a u hengekire uno honi na piruka mwene mukwa ku u ratura. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Nyambi yodiyo yofoci pohuma Mukwakupaka murao no Mukwakuratura. Aye yofoci yodiyo o ku twethsa ku yoyithsa nji kwipaa. Uno honi owe ne yowe odye ci o rature muenthzoe?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa cinunekera yo ku rupara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Mu ni teerere, amwe mu na ambanga ci: “Rero nji peunthza kenge tu thza mothzi mbongi nji thziya no ku kekaramo mwaka o ku tu tendamo miuro no ku wana rukuru.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Unone ka mu dimuka ci ine ya ku tendahara peunthza. Mwoyo woe po waa cipitura eci dyundu edi di na monaharanga thsikati thsothsipu pohuma no ku pwa. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Mwaa roera ku ambanga kenge ci: “Ngeci wa i shime Fumu, kenge tu yoya no ku kwama eyi nji iya.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Unone amwe mwaa cinuneka no ku cishangara, uno honi ouhe oo mununa o kengeyo po omango.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Munu yomuhe o ku dimuka owa ou a na roera ku kwama, unone kadi wa ku u kwama, na tende thsivi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Ku nomenithsa afumanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Mu teerere amwe mwafumanyi, mu dire no ku kuana mukaci ko makando oakuru aa a mi keyera ku rupara. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Rufumo rwenu ru noro, nevata yenu i na diwa ku menje. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Gauda no silivera wenu i na yara ñarawe, karo ñarawe thzayo kenge thza kwikara ombangi omango wenu no kwañithsa erama yenu eci mudiro. Mu na ciungumekera rufumo mu mayuwa o mahurerero. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ka na mu horithsa anu awa na coro makanda enu. Mu teerere! Kucoyoka kowa na coro makanda enu mukaci ko ku wa pupirika kwaa mi direra. Thsidiro thso thsi na ka wera mu matwi a Fumu Shokoro Ouhe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Fumu Shokoro Ouhe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabaoti.</char></note>.<verse eid="JAS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Na mu yoyo nawa no ku cikora muno mu kaye, na mu cinunithsera mwathsinda diyuwa dyo kwipaiwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Na mu ratura no kwipaa anu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike thzaa monithsa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Munu o kupira murandu.”</char></note> o kupira murandu, awo ka na mi kanena.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu cithzue micima mu makando</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Andengenu, mu kwate micima uno mu taterera kukeya kwa Fumu. Mu mone njimi edi a na cithzuanga mucima o ku taterera muve ci u rete dicora dyodikuru mu thsivaka, ku tatekera ku mvura o thsikaravanthzi shime ku ka kuma ku mvura o dikurahoke. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Namwe mu kwate micima kengeyo. Mu ndumepe, inene kukeya kwa Fumu pepi ku di. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Andengenu, mwa citatokatatoka mu kaci kenu ci katere mwa ku raturiwe. Mu mone, mukwakuratura o nemana pa thsero!<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Andengenu, mu anekere akwakukethza awa ambire mu dithzina dya Fumu edi a kwatire micima ou ekarire mu makando. Namwe mu temunune kukwata kwo micima. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Mu na dimuka ci a di no thsiyauthzi anu awa na citanarithsanga mwikati yo makando. Mwa yuva ya Jovo edi a cithzuire mucima nedi a mu tendire Fumu ku hura, inene Fumu Nyambi po wa ku yara ñekeñeke no ñeke. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Andengenu, thsothsikuru nene po ethsi, mwethza ngoro, ikare ko diwiru nji ko kaye nji ngara thsinu. Mu ambe pohuma ci “Ii” nji ci “Dyombo,” ci katere mwa ku raturiwe.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsirombero thso thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ene kwaa di ku kwenu oyu di mu dikando? A rombere kwa Nyambi. Ene kwaa di oyu na nyanyuka? Embe membo o ku shangara. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ene kwaa di ku kwenu oyu na koro? Ethse akuru o kereke ci na mu romberere, no ku mu wethsa maathzi mu dithzina dya Fumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Thsirombero thso ku tenda ko thsitawo thsaa yoyithsa mukwakukora, karo Fumu kenge a mu pindura. Karo ngeci o di no thsivi, aa teteriwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Mweyo, mu citongore evi yenu mu kaci kenu, no ku ciromberera ci mu porithsiwe. Thsirombero thso munu o muwawa, thsi di nokoro nene nekwama yoikuru.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya po nedi munu eci dyodi tu di atwe. Ou a romberire ko mucima wenthzi ouhe ci mvura a roka, kwa pitire myaka thzihatu no maonda mutanu na thzofoci mvura kadi wa ku roka mu kaye. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Ou a romberire karo ci mvura a roke, diwiru dya rokithsire mvura no kaye ka menithsire edya.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku huthsera mu dikuñwa dyo shemwa awa na u mu thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Andengenu, ngeci yumweya ku kwenu aa yonga ku tunda mu dikuñwa dyo shemwa, karo munu yumweya ayepo ka mu huthsa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mu dimuke ci munu yomuhe o ku tundithsa munu o thsivi mu dikuñwa dyenthzi dyo kwipa o na yoyithsa mwoyo oya munu no ku reta ci evi yenthzi yoingi yoihe i teteriwe.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>